{"sha": "82543f58662474359f15fed0eb251ef89e10a72569bb938588e02a734f63d811", "body": ["\\begin{proof}", "闪锌矿型：4 个阴离子位于面心立方晶格上，4 个阳离子占据", "8 个四面体间隙中的一半。位于 $(\\frac a4,\\frac a4,\\frac a4)$ 的", "四面体间隙与其四个阴离子的距离为 $\\frac{a\\sqrt3}{4}$。萤石型：4 个阳离子和", "8 个阴离子占据全部四面体间隙，比例为 $1:2$。晶胞内的 8 个阴离子", "构成棱长为 $a/2$ 的立方体，每隔一个小立方体的中心放一个阳离子；", "每个阴离子的 4 个阳离子近邻位于", "$\\frac{a\\sqrt3}{4}$ 处。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\tdplotsetmaincoords{60}{100}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "  \\begin{scope}[on background layer]", "    \\draw[black!45, line width=1.2pt] (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (0,0,3) (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (0,1.5,1.5) (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (1.5,0,1.5) (0.75,0.75,2.25) -- (1.5,1.5,3) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (0,1.5,1.5) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (0,3,0) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (1.5,1.5,0) (0.75,2.25,0.75) -- (1.5,3,1.5) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (1.5,0,1.5) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (1.5,1.5,0) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (3,0,0) (2.25,0.75,0.75) -- (3,1.5,1.5) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (1.5,1.5,3) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (1.5,3,1.5) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (3,1.5,1.5) (2.25,2.25,2.25) -- (3,3,3);", "  \\end{scope}", "    \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={gray!60}{3.6mm}] at (0.75,2.25,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={gray!60}{3.6mm}] at (0.75,0.75,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={gray!60}{3.6mm}] at (2.25,0.75,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={gray!60}{3.6mm}] at (2.25,2.25,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={yellow!75!orange}{6mm}] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\node at (1.5,1.5,-1.75) {\\ce{ZnS} (闪锌矿型)};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "\\hspace{1cm}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[tdplot_main_coords, font=\\small]", "  \\pic {omcubeo={3}};", "    \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (0,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (0,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (0,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (0.75,0.75,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (0.75,2.25,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (0,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (1.5,1.5,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (0.75,0.75,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (0,3,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (1.5,0,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (0.75,2.25,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (2.25,0.75,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (1.5,3,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (3,0,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (2.25,2.25,0.75) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (1.5,1.5,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (3,3,0) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (2.25,0.75,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!45!yellow}{5.0mm}] at (2.25,2.25,2.25) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (3,1.5,1.5) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (3,0,3) {};", "  \\node[aX={green!35!gray}{4.4mm}] at (3,3,3) {};", "  \\node at (1.5,1.5,-1.75) {\\ce{CaF2} (萤石型)};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左：闪锌矿型，\\ce{S^{2-}}（黄色）位于面心立方晶格上，", "\\ce{Zn^{2+}}（灰色）位于隔一个的四面体间隙中，每个都与其四个近邻相连。", "右：萤石型，\\ce{Ca^{2+}}（灰绿色）位于面心立方晶格上，", "\\ce{F-}（浅绿色）位于全部八个四面体间隙中。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{example}[闪锌矿型与萤石型]\\label{ex:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:zns}", "闪锌矿型的 $a = \\qty{540.9}{pm}$，$r_+ + r_- = a\\sqrt3/4 =", "\\qty{234.2}{pm}$（Shannon：$60 + 184 = \\qty{244}{pm}$，硫化物半径", "仅在六配位时列出），且 $x = 60/184 = 0.33$，位于", "四面体范围内。萤石型的 $a = \\qty{546.3}{pm}$，$r_+ + r_- =", "\\qty{236.6}{pm}$（Shannon：$112 + 131 = \\qty{243}{pm}$），且 $x = 0.85$：", "阳离子位于由 8 个阴离子构成的立方体中，与该规则相符。", "% ledger: lat:ZnS, rion:Zn2+IV, rion:S2-VI, lat:CaF2, rion:Ca2+VIII,", "% rion:F-IV", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{method}[预测结构]\\label{met:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:predict}", "预测离子化合物 \\ce{MX} 或 \\ce{MX2} 的结构时：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 由表中半径计算 $x = r_+/r_-$（对应预期的", "        配位数）；", "  \\item 由半径比规则读出阳离子的配位数；", "  \\item 选择具有该配位数且化学式正确的类型：", "        \\ce{MX} 配位数为 8 时取 \\ce{CsCl}；6 时取 \\ce{NaCl}；4 时取闪锌矿型；", "        \\ce{MX2} 配位数为 8 时取萤石型。", "  \\item 与实测晶胞参数对照；注意：", "        可极化离子（\\ce{S^{2-}}、\\ce{I-}）以及小而带高电荷的阳离子", "        会使键具有部分共价性，此时该规则失效。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{共价晶体}", "", "\\begin{definition}[共价晶体]\\label{def:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:covalent-crystal}", "称 \\emph{共价晶体}\\index{共价晶体}（或网络固体）为", "一种晶体，其中所有原子通过共价键连接成一个", "巨大分子，如金刚石、硅、石英 \\ce{SiO2}。在层状", "共价晶体（如石墨）中，共价网络仅在", "平面内延伸，各平面之间由范德华相互作用相互结合。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[金刚石结构]\\label{prop:b1:crystals-ionic-covalent:diamond}", "金刚石中，碳原子占据面心立方晶格及其", "一半四面体间隙，与闪锌矿型中两种离子的情形相同：$Z = 8$，每个", "碳原子与其他四个碳原子成键，这四个原子位于四面体的顶点，", "距离为 $a\\sqrt3/4$。对于相切的球，堆积率为", "\\[", "  C = \\frac{\\pi\\sqrt3}{16} \\approx 0.34 .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", ""]}